      "title": "Madison County: Public Service Commission jurisdiction over certain privately owned sewer systems (Act 2026-323)",
      "summary": "A local amendment to the Constitution of Alabama of 2022 that applies only to Madison County. It would place certain privately owned sewer systems that use public rights-of-way of public roads under the jurisdiction of the Alabama Public Service Commission, under certain conditions.",
